 omedy Festival in Austin and co-hosts the popular reality TV podcast\, Are 
 You My Podcast? \, with fellow comedian\, Sarah Colonna. Mary and Sarah hav
 e co-hosted several “Married at First Sight” clip shows on Lifetime. He
 r comedy album\, Discomfortable \, can be heard on all streaming platforms 
 as well as Sirius XM. Her debut comedy special\, Not Anymore \, produced by
  Helium Comedy Studios\, is now available on YouTube.This show is 21+ (18+ 
